{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_a6d18f4ce77c2fa6edf69eb5426a5fe440bf8fc20586030948f1c4233057af85"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: a pre-push checklist mandates cargo fmt --check, cargo check -p aether-win32, and cargo test --workspace --lib --no-fail-fast; the README also documents workspace tests run with CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 to avoid an ICE, clippy with -D warnings, a GUI smoke test script, and a coverage script."},{"claim_ids":["clm_efc3db0ad90748a6fc14286ab0201f689380daf83b294216402cae9af2185a3c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: CONTRIBUTING.md requires external contributors to use a fork workflow, branch from dev (temp/ or fix/ prefixes), target PRs at dev rather than main, and follow a <type>(<scope>): <description> commit format with types like feat, fix, perf, and refactor."}],"claim_ids":["clm_a6d18f4ce77c2fa6edf69eb5426a5fe440bf8fc20586030948f1c4233057af85","clm_efc3db0ad90748a6fc14286ab0201f689380daf83b294216402cae9af2185a3c"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_83eb460cb828491ab4988bb7b3317629","id":"pg_18b6b3641c6e5f9da986ec7cf2980c28","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aetherstudio-cn-aetherstudio-contributing-md-f7fcd26149f2-ec7cf2980c28.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_4d237f01b686541eb87386cb5f8a0e86"],"title":"aetherstudio-cn/AetherStudio/CONTRIBUTING.md @ f7fcd26149f2","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_83eb460cb828491ab4988bb7b3317629"}
